{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で言われる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『あ、箸さん！』『あ！箸の！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"箸を持っていたが、けっして私は箸ではない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先入観の恐ろしさを実感する。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして 勝手に自己満でやるpart2."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2015年 年齢戻りまくり集"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかですね、とりあえず年齢が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気分とメイクや髪型や服装によって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてつもなく左右される人間らしいです私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/01/11/8813514/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/01/11/8813514/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/01/11/8813514/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/01/11/8813514/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中で意味からない《ほ》という"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平仮名が入りましたが、不本意です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただなんか 上手く消えないので放置です。ほ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は不二子になりた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば 舞台 ヴァンガードで"},{"type":"break"},{"typ